WEBVTT

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
moo-shi

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
presents:

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
http://moo-shi.no-ip.info/ #moo-shi@irc.rizon.net

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:44.220
<i>Goodbye.</i>

00:01:46.610 --> 00:01:49.440
<i>Looks like we might never meet again.</i>

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:51.440
Junko!

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:58.730
<i>I did manage to survive, thanks to you.</i>

00:01:59.770 --> 00:02:04.160
<i>But I wound up arrested by
the Oasis government instead...</i>

00:02:05.110 --> 00:02:07.140
<i>I'm not blaming you, though.</i>

00:02:07.780 --> 00:02:10.710
<i>I know very well you did
everything you possibly could!</i>

00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:14.080
<i>This is just your limit.</i>

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:16.920
<i>Oh, yes.</i>

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:21.850
<i>I said to win me over
if you really wanted me...</i>

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:25.850
<i>But I'd never fall for the likes of you.</i>

00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:31.560
<i>The likes of you... Never...</i>

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:33.620
<i>Goodbye!</i>

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:38.120
No!

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:52.850
<i>Master!</i>

00:02:52.850 --> 00:02:56.240
<i>Will you pull yourself together already?!</i>

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:58.340
<i>It's already been a week!</i>

00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:01.470
<i>That woman's a goner, I tell you!</i>

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:05.590
<i>She got hauled off by a
heartless intelligence agency!</i>

00:03:05.590 --> 00:03:09.900
<i>She's probably died a heroic death
after being horribly tortured!</i>

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:15.480
<i>Uhh, Master?</i>

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:19.280
You've been jittery day and night...

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:23.200
We got nothin', yet you're wasting
batteries burrowing everywhere!

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:28.450
<i>B-but there's no telling when the
authorities will come to arrest us...</i>

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:31.710
<i>If that woman rats us out!</i>

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:35.630
Moron.

00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:41.540
If they felt so inclined, we could
flail all we want and still not survive.

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:43.550
They tear up contracts, you know.

00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:49.500
West Oasis government contracts
are absolute in this region.

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:52.560
Which is why we can even
put our lives on the line.

00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:58.020
And yet... he just tore it up like
that to suit the government's needs!

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:03.440
We're just insignificant nothings...

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:06.910
We eat and shit in the palm
of the government's hand...

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:12.870
<i>The government does operate
those food transport and vacuum cars...</i>

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:16.880
Whatever the case, there's no point
in kicking and screaming now.

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:21.880
Well, we will kick and scream plenty
when the time comes, though!

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:32.480
Chinoike Archaeology Team?

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:34.590
<i>I'm the captain, Chinoike.</i>

00:04:34.590 --> 00:04:37.610
<i>Is your job to excavate the ruins?</i>

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:39.730
<i>No, actually...</i>

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:42.580
<i>...it's to find someone.</i>

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:46.450
What're you excavating for?
These ruins've been dug completely dry...

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:50.330
<i>The treasure may be gone, but there's
still academic value to be had...</i>

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:54.220
So, who're we lookin' for?

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:57.500
Think you can start talking to us?

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:01.610
<i>Well... It's a soldier.</i>

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:02.510
Soldier?

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:04.840
For the West Oasis government?

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:06.020
<i>Yes.</i>

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:11.760
<i>Excavating has its dangers, so I
needed someone to protect the team...</i>

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:17.560
<i>Some weird guys suddenly attacked,
and many of my men were killed!</i>

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:19.010
<i>And that soldier...</i>

00:05:19.010 --> 00:05:19.900
Get down!

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:28.360
You?!

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:30.120
<i>K-Kanta?!</i>

00:05:31.590 --> 00:05:32.490
<i>Oh?</i>

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:34.250
<i>It's Kanta?!</i>

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:41.210
I'm on a job. What the hell
are you doing here?

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:47.090
<i>Q-quit crying! Hey!</i>

00:05:47.090 --> 00:05:48.450
<i>Natsuko...</i>

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:51.760
<i>is missing...</i>

00:05:54.420 --> 00:06:00.030
<i>She was on a secret mission,
so she's not "officially" missing!</i>

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:03.270
<i>So they haven't even started
to search for her yet!</i>

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:10.740
It'd seem your guys' goal is
the same as this here fellow's.

00:06:11.310 --> 00:06:16.080
These guys are brothers of the
Sergeant Kawaguchi you're lookin' for.

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:16.570
<i>Eh?</i>

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:18.120
<i>Huh?</i>

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:21.900
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:23.920
Well, then...

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:27.470
If we're after the same thing,
then it's simple.

00:06:28.140 --> 00:06:30.300
Let's work together to find Natsuko.

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.850
<i>- You'll help?!</i>

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.850
- My bones!

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:36.430
<i>Say, were you looking around this town?</i>

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:37.160
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:39.360
<i>Must've been one lousy tipster!</i>

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:42.220
<i>What?! What do you mean?!</i>

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:43.730
<i>What do you mean, lousy?!</i>

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:46.110
<i>No... You don't understand...</i>

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:50.320
<i>Sergeant Kawaguchi was
attacked down below!</i>

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:52.120
<i>Below?!</i>

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:04.660
<i>I never would've guessed!</i>

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:06.550
<i>No wonder we couldn't find her!</i>

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:08.100
<i>Listen.</i>

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:12.110
<i>The existence of this entrance is
top-secret even within the government.</i>

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:13.890
<i>Should you ever leak
its location, you'll...</i>

00:07:13.890 --> 00:07:14.890
Shut up!

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:18.020
Quit with the advertisement
and just lead the way!

00:07:18.020 --> 00:07:19.140
<i>How horrible!</i>

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:21.010
OK! Let's go!

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:22.970
<i>Master!</i>

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:30.350
<i>- We're coming, Natsuko!
- Hang in there!</i>

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:42.300
<i>Sawada-san. The heat sources
have disappeared.</i>

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:43.900
<i>Pursuit is not possible.</i>

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:47.590
<i>As if humans can just disappear!</i>

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:50.890
<i>You good-for-nothing puppets!
Listen and learn!</i>

00:07:50.890 --> 00:07:52.970
<i>People don't suddenly disappear!</i>

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:54.960
<i>They either have
heat-concealing equipment</i>

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:57.310
<i>or they've gone somewhere
our sensors can't penetrate!</i>

00:07:57.560 --> 00:07:58.280
<i>Understood.</i>

00:07:58.800 --> 00:07:59.810
<i>It has been noted.</i>

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:04.310
<i>Let's go after 'em.</i>

00:08:08.140 --> 00:08:10.530
<i>What is this huge space?!</i>

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:14.330
<i>I never imagined this
was beneath the ruins!</i>

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:16.020
<i>Incredible, isn't it?</i>

00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:19.060
<i>Not even the government's top men know about it.</i>

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:20.910
<i>It's our little secret.</i>

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:26.720
<i>It's a legendary Dark Age city,
3000 meters underground.</i>

00:08:26.720 --> 00:08:27.880
Legendary, indeed...

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:30.340
But it sure is incredible...

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:33.340
There's metal and plastic everywhere!

00:08:34.050 --> 00:08:36.590
Even stuff I've never seen before.

00:08:41.440 --> 00:08:46.870
I could live the big-life 10 times over
just off of the stuff I see here!

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:49.490
<i>This is nothing at all!</i>

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:53.290
<i>All the other ruins out there've
been dug dry, but not these!</i>

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:56.660
<i>Yeah! The guys in town'd be
so happy if they knew!</i>

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:00.660
<i>Master! Look at this.</i>

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:02.190
What, now?

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:05.600
<i>- This...</i>

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:05.600
- What is it?

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:12.630
<i>15 December 3026
Matsushita Ken'ichi</i>

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:11.150
December 15, 3026?

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:12.620
<i>It's a message.</i>

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:17.960
<i>Meant to tell surviving friends
and family that one was still all right.</i>

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:19.600
<i>They're all over the place.</i>

00:09:20.070 --> 00:09:22.790
<i>Mothers looking for their children...</i>

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:25.350
<i>Prayers for the safety of loved ones...</i>

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:30.180
Looks like it's been
carved over scorch marks...

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:32.620
<i>The ceiling also has scorch marks.</i>

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:37.530
<i>It seems the entire tunnel
was enveloped in flames.</i>

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:40.730
<i>W-what do you think happened?!</i>

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:43.950
<i>Who knows. Buncha people
probably died, though...</i>

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:47.820
<i>Books say the Dark Age had
a super-advanced civilization</i>

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:51.200
<i>that even went to
the world of the stars...</i>

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:55.970
<i>For it to fall,
something really big must've happened...</i>

00:09:57.290 --> 00:10:00.880
<i>Do you suppose
Matsushita-san found his companion?</i>

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:04.290
Who knows. It was hundreds of years ago.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:10.140
<i>W-wait for me!</i>

00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:10.860
<i>South Entrance</i>

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:19.030
<i>I know this! I saw it in a book!</i>

00:10:19.030 --> 00:10:21.700
<i>Let me think!</i>

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:23.100
<i>A "train"!</i>

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:29.710
<i>It's so awesome!</i>

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:30.890
<i>Sweet!</i>

00:10:30.890 --> 00:10:32.080
<i>So cool!</i>

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:42.920
Hey, does this thing mean the
underground city was insanely huge?!

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:48.470
<i>I've studied the underground city
for many years now...</i>

00:10:48.470 --> 00:10:51.300
<i>Apparently, it stretched
across the entire Kanto Plain</i>

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:53.860
<i>around the end of the Dark Age.</i>

00:10:54.440 --> 00:10:57.520
<i>Meaning it goes all beneath
the Great Kanto Desert?!</i>

00:10:57.520 --> 00:11:00.990
<i>Yes. Most of it caved in, though.</i>

00:11:01.380 --> 00:11:06.700
<i>It seems this was the only place
to flee to when the Dark Age ended.</i>

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:09.220
What a drag.

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:15.730
Looks like they dug their own
giant grave for themselves.

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:21.010
So, what's the deal with Natsuko?

00:11:21.010 --> 00:11:23.180
<i>Come with me!</i>

00:12:04.170 --> 00:12:06.260
<i>Sunabouzu-san...</i>

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:08.840
<i>Have you ever been to the Oasis?</i>

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:13.760
Yeah, my old man took me
there once when I was a kid.

00:12:13.760 --> 00:12:15.770
Only saw the entrance, though...

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:32.710
I remember it clearly...

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:37.190
That gigantic, intimidating entrance...

00:12:38.460 --> 00:12:41.590
It was so big, I almost lost my lunch...

00:12:42.350 --> 00:12:44.970
I recall the whole area
being packed with people

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:47.890
hoping to get scraps
from the government...

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:54.260
<i>So it's a town full of purveying
salesmen and branch offices?</i>

00:12:54.260 --> 00:12:59.840
It's a central water station
and grimy town for government flunkies.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:03.400
<i>I happen to live in that town...</i>

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:04.360
That so?

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:07.350
<i>Never mind.</i>

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:10.280
<i>But do you know
what it's like on the inside?</i>

00:13:10.490 --> 00:13:15.960
Well, from what I've heard, it's a
really huge underground city that...

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:17.420
<i>Underground city?!</i>

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:20.050
<i>An amazing underground city.</i>

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:22.420
<i>Too big even for the government.</i>

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:24.510
<i>But it comes as no surprise;</i>

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:28.340
<i>the government is housed inside
ultra-enormous underground ruins...</i>

00:13:28.340 --> 00:13:31.810
<i>A giant structure
extending 3000 meters down.</i>

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:34.430
<i>The government doesn't
use even half of it.</i>

00:13:34.430 --> 00:13:37.060
<i>There are still many unknown parts to it.</i>

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:38.620
<i>Incredible, isn't it?</i>

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:43.960
No... I just get a really
bad feeling about this all...

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:48.070
<i>It happened some 10 years ago...</i>

00:13:48.670 --> 00:13:53.910
<i>A survey engineer went missing
in the deepest part of the West Oasis.</i>

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:56.090
<i>It's a veritable maze down there;</i>

00:13:56.090 --> 00:13:59.460
<i>once you've wandered in,
there's little hope of survival.</i>

00:14:00.760 --> 00:14:05.300
<i>However, the engineer was
discovered one week later...</i>

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:11.300
<i>In a completely different location,
50 kilometers from the West Oasis.</i>

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:16.310
In short, he wound up in
the ruins we're in now?!

00:14:17.860 --> 00:14:22.230
<i>Impressive, Sunabouzu-san!
Being so quick saves me trouble!</i>

00:14:22.230 --> 00:14:26.990
Basically, it's the back door
to the West Oasis?!

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:31.280
<i>10 years ago, I came to explore the ruins</i>

00:14:31.280 --> 00:14:34.290
<i>and learned of it from his final words...</i>

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:37.710
<i>Learned of this underground city...</i>

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:41.960
<i>The man died?</i>

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:44.070
<i>Yes...</i>

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:49.380
<i>After being subjected to a week of
terror and despair in total darkness...</i>

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:54.430
<i>We gave him a nice burial with miners
who had died in an accident.</i>

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:03.690
I see. So you didn't
hand him over to his family...

00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:07.190
<i>Nope.</i>

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:12.450
If word about him got out, so would
word about this huge discovery.

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:18.160
Shit!

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:19.720
What the hell?!

00:15:20.320 --> 00:15:22.490
This is way too much!

00:15:22.490 --> 00:15:25.260
How can you just do this to people?!

00:15:25.260 --> 00:15:27.380
<i>Whoa, what're you talking about, Kanta?!</i>

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:29.670
Don't you get it yet?!

00:15:29.670 --> 00:15:31.870
We're prowling around
a back door to the Oasis

00:15:31.870 --> 00:15:33.560
that the government doesn't know about!

00:15:33.560 --> 00:15:35.220
This is big-time terrorism!

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:40.730
We've been caught in
an anti-government movement!

00:15:45.470 --> 00:15:49.750
<i>I do live in the center
and work for the government,</i>

00:15:49.750 --> 00:15:52.780
<i>but I'm from the desert too, you know.</i>

00:15:53.490 --> 00:15:57.120
<i>Anti-government movement?!
That makes you Natsuko's enemy!</i>

00:15:57.530 --> 00:16:01.910
<i>Is it 'cause of your friends
that Natsuko's unit is missing?!</i>

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:02.780
<i>N-no.</i>

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:05.280
<i>Ow...</i>

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:06.750
<i>M-my gun!</i>

00:16:07.220 --> 00:16:08.210
<i>W-what are you...</i>

00:16:10.770 --> 00:16:12.260
<i>S-stop!</i>

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:23.190
Alright! Get the hell out here!

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:29.740
<i>How did he know we were here?! We're...</i>

00:16:30.230 --> 00:16:31.250
<i>Ascertainment.</i>

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:33.740
<i>Condition... Minor damage.</i>

00:16:34.150 --> 00:16:37.980
<i>We have not been instructed how
to react to a preemptive attack.</i>

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:39.490
<i>Please issue your command.</i>

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:40.580
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:43.070
<i>Do I have to tell you everything?!</i>

00:16:43.070 --> 00:16:46.150
<i>Wait, I do.</i>

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:49.110
<i>Your pursuit has failed,
so take drastic measures!</i>

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:52.210
<i>Capture the appropriate guy
and force 'im to talk!</i>

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:53.840
<i>I don't think so.</i>

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:57.680
<i>W-when did they...</i>

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:03.640
<i>Can't have you leaving
with info on this place...</i>

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:05.390
<i>Fire.</i>

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:10.730
<i>What?!</i>

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:20.200
Huh?! Looks like something
unexpected's just started...

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:22.040
What's goin' on?!

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:29.960
<i>You've been followed, brothers.</i>

00:17:38.510 --> 00:17:40.260
<i>- Natsuko!
- Natsu-ne!
- Natsuko-san!</i>

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:46.050
<i>That's... right...</i>

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:49.910
<i>Natsuko! We heard you
were attacked, so we...</i>

00:17:49.910 --> 00:17:51.320
<i>You're not hurt?!</i>

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:52.730
Of course not.

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:55.240
This was all made up.

00:17:57.170 --> 00:17:58.700
I finally get it!

00:17:59.380 --> 00:18:03.000
It looked like you were playing
a damned-serious government dog,

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:07.710
but you're actually an anti-government
factionist like him, Natsuko!

00:18:10.260 --> 00:18:12.670
<i>Let's just say I'm from the desert, too.</i>

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:13.960
<i>Listen!</i>

00:18:14.520 --> 00:18:18.930
<i>I don't care if you wipe out all
the soldiers! This is your debut!</i>

00:18:19.190 --> 00:18:23.410
<i>Try out the combat techniques taught
to you to your hearts' content!</i>

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:24.390
<i>Understood.</i>

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:27.730
<i>What?!</i>

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:32.110
<i>But capture the commander alive!</i>

00:18:36.350 --> 00:18:37.900
<i>I want to learn the details!</i>

00:18:40.570 --> 00:18:41.490
<i>What the hell is he?!</i>

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:43.490
<i>I have a query.</i>

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:51.420
<i>How does one distinguish
between commander and soldier?</i>

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:55.770
<i>I gotta spell that out for you, too?!</i>

00:18:55.770 --> 00:19:00.720
<i>The commander's the guy who's
surrounded by soldiers and acts big!</i>

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:02.720
<i>If you can't tell, just seize 'em all!</i>

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:07.220
Why'd you guys cook up a
roundabout job to get me involved?!

00:19:07.690 --> 00:19:11.880
Yes, I know I'm famous
in the Kanto for my skill!

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:15.260
So I fully understand
why you'd want me to join you!

00:19:16.910 --> 00:19:19.750
Why'd you show me your trump card of a tunnel

00:19:19.750 --> 00:19:22.920
before you knew what I was gonna do?!

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:24.730
What are you thinking?!

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:25.750
<i>I agree.</i>

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:26.450
What?!

00:19:27.110 --> 00:19:31.780
<i>I don't trust you either,
and I'm against having you join, too.</i>

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:34.530
<i>But there's someone who wants you.</i>

00:19:34.530 --> 00:19:35.460
What, now?!

00:19:35.910 --> 00:19:39.970
What's there to gain by this?!
Who is this connoisseur?!

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:45.110
<i>You'll find out soon enough.
But let me make this clear.</i>

00:19:45.110 --> 00:19:48.910
<i>We did not form this group
for self-interest.</i>

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:51.980
<i>We want to make the desert
a slightly better place.</i>

00:19:53.320 --> 00:19:56.360
<i>A place where the people
of the desert can unite</i>

00:19:56.360 --> 00:20:00.640
<i>and where even the poor
and weak can live in peace...</i>

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:02.910
<i>We wish to make such a world!</i>

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:06.010
<i>He just said what Master hates most...</i>

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:08.200
<i>Shit happens!</i>

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:12.080
What'd you say?!

00:20:13.280 --> 00:20:17.170
<i>Himuro! Respond! Shiozaki!
How's the right flank holding?!</i>

00:20:17.170 --> 00:20:21.170
<i>This is Shiozaki! I'm the
only one in Squad #2 still...</i>

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:24.920
<i>Seize them all...</i>

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:26.460
<i>Seize them all...</i>

00:20:26.460 --> 00:20:28.030
<i>Seize them all...</i>

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:29.180
<i>Seize them all...</i>

00:20:29.810 --> 00:20:34.060
<i>No question about it! The damn
government has invested in 'em!</i>

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:36.610
<i>Sergeant Kawaguchi! We're pulling out!</i>

00:20:37.050 --> 00:20:41.030
<i>Roger. The Sunabouzu has been secured.</i>

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:42.440
<i>Where's Kanta?!</i>

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:47.510
<i>Master! We're going
to abandon Natsuko-san?!</i>

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:52.160
Dumbass! We don't owe the government
or the factionists anything!

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:53.930
We ain't gonna get involved!

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:56.020
<i>Y-yes, but...</i>

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:56.750
Let's go!

00:20:57.580 --> 00:20:58.340
<i>Master!</i>

00:21:13.390 --> 00:21:14.520
The same kind as him?!

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:28.280
<i>He fell for the trap!</i>

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:30.880
<i>Too bright!</i>

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:34.230
<i>Damn! How can you fall for such tricks?!</i>

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:35.710
<i>Samesuga! Damage?!</i>

00:21:40.710 --> 00:21:44.170
<i>Minor. No problem posed
to continuance of operation.</i>

00:21:46.710 --> 00:21:50.920
How can they be so damn strong,
yet so damn stupid?!

00:21:50.920 --> 00:21:52.430
<i>Same goes for you.</i>

00:21:53.770 --> 00:21:55.100
<i>N-Natsuko-san!</i>

00:21:57.300 --> 00:22:02.070
<i>I'd greatly appreciate it if you'd
follow me with your own two legs...</i>

00:22:07.250 --> 00:22:08.450
<i>Of course.</i>

00:23:54.850 --> 00:23:57.560
<i>Hey! Fine Man of the Desert,
Kaido Masaru here!</i>

00:23:57.560 --> 00:24:00.050
<i>Sunabouzu! We'll never
forget your bravery!</i>

00:24:00.050 --> 00:24:01.730
<i>Hey! Don't say such ominous crap!</i>

00:24:01.730 --> 00:24:02.690
<i>If you say so.</i>

00:24:02.690 --> 00:24:05.500
<i>And thus Master became
a blue shooting star...</i>

00:24:05.530 --> 00:24:07.040
<i>Next episode-
"Reverse and Handy"</i>

00:24:07.040 --> 00:24:08.520
<i>Miss it and you'll be punished heavily!</i>

00:24:08.520 --> 00:24:09.490
<i>You're serious?!</i>
